      ],
      "image": "assets/images/81112/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cream cheese, 1/2 cup milk, and garlic in a large pot over low heat; cook and stir until blended, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c-lS3i_BUApwLclIss_vovIJTbE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/81112_SeafoodChowder_ddmfs_4x3_step2_gw_0432-11a44c5d10e6420fb92863227d1de569.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/81112/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in condensed soup, undrained corn, remaining 1 cup milk, potatoes, green onions, carrots, parsley, black pepper, and cayenne pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cit7wUZUdi-ZSJj8LEhMUFFUSJQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/81112_SeafoodChowder_ddmfs_4x3_step3_gw_0433-ee48ede4a19c487384d1b2f6e11193d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/81112/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer for 25 minutes, stirring occasionally, without letting the chowder boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ijy21xC_F3b5cChNXkBtteQIkhY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/81112_SeafoodChowder_ddmfs_4x3_step4_gw_0436-188c5cd001dd4d94859deabe23bca991.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/81112/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add shrimp, scallops, crab, calamari, and clams; cook until seafood is opaque, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
